  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Package Managers: The Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Package Managers: The Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What It Does",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Resolves dependencies== automatically",
                "Downloads {blue:signed} packages from ==repositories==",
                "Records installed files in a ==local database=="
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Two Layers, Two Families",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Debian family",
                "RHEL family"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Distros",
                  "Ubuntu, Mint",
                  "Fedora, Rocky, Alma"
                ],
                [
                  "Package",
                  "`.deb`",
                  "`.rpm`"
                ],
                [
                  "Low-level",
                  "`dpkg`: one local file, no dependency resolution",
                  "`rpm`: one local file, no dependency resolution"
                ],
                [
                  "High-level",
                  "`apt`: fetches from repos, resolves dependencies",
                  "`dnf`: fetches from repos, resolves dependencies"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Cached index",
                    "sub": "repo metadata",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "apt / dnf",
                    "sub": "resolve, download",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "dpkg / rpm",
                    "sub": "install each file",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Local database",
                    "sub": "files recorded",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Index is a cache",
              "text": "Installs use the ==cached index==, not the live server. A stale index means 404s or old versions."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**dpkg -i fails, apt succeeds?** dpkg resolves nothing; apt fetches missing dependencies",
                "**apt vs apt-get?** apt is the friendly front end; apt-get is the older, script-stable one",
                "**dnf under the hood?** It calls ==rpm== to install, and uses repo metadata to resolve"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Core Workflow: Update, Upgrade and Install",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Core Workflow: Update, Upgrade and Install",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Update vs Upgrade",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`apt update` ==refreshes the index== only; it installs nothing",
                "`apt upgrade` installs newer versions of installed packages; it ==never removes==",
                "`apt full-upgrade` (dist-upgrade) may remove or add packages to fix dependencies"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "apt",
                "dnf"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Refresh index",
                  "`apt update`",
                  "no separate step"
                ],
                [
                  "Upgrade",
                  "`apt upgrade`",
                  "`dnf upgrade` (alias `update`)"
                ],
                [
                  "Dependencies changed",
                  "`apt full-upgrade`",
                  "`dnf upgrade` (also removes or adds as needed)"
                ],
                [
                  "Preview",
                  "`apt list --upgradable`",
                  "`dnf check-update`"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Safe Order and Install",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "apt update",
                    "sub": "refresh index",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "apt upgrade",
                    "sub": "newer versions",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "apt install pkg",
                    "sub": "from fresh index",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Both families need ==root==, so use `sudo`",
                "`-y` ==auto-confirms== prompts"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "sudo apt install -y nginx",
                "sudo dnf install -y nginx"
              ],
              "note": "Debian family, then RHEL family"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Stale index",
              "text": "Installing without `apt update` first gives ==404== errors or old versions."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**update vs upgrade?** update refreshes the index; upgrade installs newer versions",
                "**When full-upgrade?** When changed dependencies force packages to be removed or added",
                "**Does dnf need a separate index command?** No: `dnf upgrade` refreshes metadata itself"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Everyday Commands: Install, Remove, Search",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Everyday Commands: Install, Remove, Search",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Search, Remove, Clean Up",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "apt",
                "dnf"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Search",
                  "`apt search kw`",
                  "`dnf search kw`"
                ],
                [
                  "Details",
                  "`apt show pkg`",
                  "`dnf info pkg`"
                ],
                [
                  "Installed",
                  "`apt list --installed`",
                  "`dnf list installed`"
                ],
                [
                  "Remove",
                  "`apt remove pkg`",
                  "`dnf remove pkg`"
                ],
                [
                  "Purge",
                  "`apt purge pkg`",
                  "{red:none}; `remove` saves edited config as `.rpmsave`"
                ],
                [
                  "Orphans",
                  "`apt autoremove`",
                  "`dnf autoremove`"
                ],
                [
                  "Cache",
                  "`apt clean`",
                  "`dnf clean all`"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 4
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`apt remove` ==keeps config files==; `apt purge` deletes them too",
                "`autoremove` deletes ==dependencies no longer needed== by any installed package"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Pin a Version",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "apt",
                "dnf"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Pin",
                  "`apt install pkg=1.2.3-1`",
                  "`dnf install pkg-1.2.3`"
                ],
                [
                  "Hold",
                  "`apt-mark hold pkg`",
                  "`dnf versionlock add pkg` (needs the plugin)"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Who Owns This File?",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Missing command or file? Search repos for the ==owning package=="
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "sudo apt install apt-file && sudo apt-file update",
                "apt-file search bin/tool",
                "dnf provides '*/bin/tool'"
              ],
              "note": "Debian family, then RHEL family"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "`remove` leaves config behind on apt. Use `purge` for a clean wipe, then `autoremove` for orphaned dependencies."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Repositories, Keys, dpkg and rpm Queries",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Repositories, Keys, dpkg and rpm Queries",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Repos and Keys",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Debian family",
                "RHEL family"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Repo config",
                  "`/etc/apt/sources.list`, `sources.list.d/*.list` or `.sources`",
                  "`/etc/yum.repos.d/*.repo`"
                ],
                [
                  "Key lines",
                  "`signed-by=` in the source line",
                  "`baseurl`, `gpgcheck=1`, `gpgkey`"
                ],
                [
                  "Key store",
                  "`/etc/apt/keyrings/`",
                  "`gpgkey` URL or `rpm --import`"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Signing keys prove package ==authenticity==",
                "`apt-key` is {red:deprecated}: one global trust for all repos",
                "Disable temporarily: `dnf --disablerepo=name install pkg` or remove the source file"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Add key",
                    "sub": "per-repo",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Add source file",
                    "sub": "signed-by=",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Refresh",
                    "sub": "apt update / dnf makecache",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Install",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Query Packages",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Task",
                "dpkg",
                "rpm"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "List all",
                  "`dpkg -l`",
                  "`rpm -qa`"
                ],
                [
                  "Files in package",
                  "`dpkg -L pkg`",
                  "`rpm -ql pkg`"
                ],
                [
                  "Owner of file",
                  "`dpkg -S /path`",
                  "`rpm -qf /path`"
                ],
                [
                  "Package info",
                  "`dpkg -s pkg`",
                  "`rpm -qi pkg`"
                ],
                [
                  "Install local file",
                  "`dpkg -i file.deb`",
                  "`rpm -ivh file.rpm`"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Where are repos configured?** apt: `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/`; dnf: `/etc/yum.repos.d/`",
                "**Why was apt-key deprecated?** It trusted a key for every repo; use `signed-by=`",
                "**Which package owns a file?** Ubuntu `dpkg -S /path`; Rocky `rpm -qf /path`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Snaps, Flatpaks and Building from Source",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Snaps, Flatpaks and Building from Source",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Snap and Flatpak",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{blue:Snap} (Canonical, `snapd`) and {green:Flatpak} (Flathub)",
                "Bundle ==app + dependencies== in a **sandbox**",
                "Runs on any distro",
                "Cost: larger size, slower first start"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Snap",
                "Flatpak"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Install",
                  "`snap install pkg`",
                  "`flatpak install flathub org.app.Name`"
                ],
                [
                  "List",
                  "`snap list`",
                  "`flatpak list`"
                ],
                [
                  "Run",
                  "`snap run pkg`",
                  "`flatpak run org.app.Name`"
                ],
                [
                  "Update",
                  "`snap refresh` (auto)",
                  "`flatpak update`"
                ],
                [
                  "Remove",
                  "`snap remove pkg`",
                  "`flatpak uninstall org.app.Name`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Building from Source",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Build tools",
                    "sub": "build-essential / Development Tools",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "./configure",
                    "sub": "--prefix=/usr/local",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "make",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "sudo make install",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`make install` tracks ==nothing==",
                "Uninstall: `make uninstall` or the source tree",
                "`--prefix=/usr/local` keeps files out of managed paths; `checkinstall` registers a package"
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Which to Use",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Order",
                "Use when",
                "Updates"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "1. Distro repo",
                  "Package exists",
                  "apt / dnf"
                ],
                [
                  "2. Snap / Flatpak",
                  "Not in repo",
                  "Auto / `flatpak update`"
                ],
                [
                  "3. Source build",
                  "Nothing else fits",
                  "None"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Slow snap?** Bundled libs, sandbox setup",
                "**make install vs apt?** No tracking, no clean uninstall, no updates",
                "**Source justified?** Need newer version or custom flags"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Source builds",
              "text": "No automatic security updates; you rebuild."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cheat Sheet: apt vs dnf",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Cheat Sheet: apt vs dnf",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Refresh, install, remove",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Task",
                "apt",
                "dnf"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Refresh index",
                  "`apt update`",
                  "optional `dnf makecache`"
                ],
                [
                  "Upgrade all",
                  "`apt upgrade`",
                  "`dnf upgrade`"
                ],
                [
                  "Preview updates",
                  "`apt list --upgradable`",
                  "`dnf check-update`"
                ],
                [
                  "Install",
                  "`apt install pkg`",
                  "`dnf install pkg`"
                ],
                [
                  "Remove",
                  "`remove` / `purge`",
                  "`dnf remove pkg`"
                ],
                [
                  "Cleanup deps",
                  "`apt autoremove`",
                  "`dnf autoremove`"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Search, inspect, local files",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Task",
                "Debian",
                "RHEL"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Search",
                  "`apt search`",
                  "`dnf search`"
                ],
                [
                  "Details",
                  "`apt show`",
                  "`dnf info`"
                ],
                [
                  "File owner",
                  "`dpkg -S path`",
                  "`rpm -qf path`, `dnf provides`"
                ],
                [
                  "Install file",
                  "`dpkg -i`",
                  "`rpm -ivh`"
                ],
                [
                  "List installed",
                  "`dpkg -l`",
                  "`rpm -qa`"
                ],
                [
                  "Files in pkg",
                  "`dpkg -L`",
                  "`rpm -ql`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Config and other formats",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Repos: `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/` vs `/etc/yum.repos.d/`",
                "`snap install pkg`, `flatpak install flathub org.app.Name`",
                "Source build is the last resort:"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "./configure",
                "make",
                "sudo make install"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Interview point",
              "text": "`apt install` = `dnf install`, `apt search` = `dnf search`, `dpkg -S` = `rpm -qf`. ==Install, remove, purge, upgrade, -i== change the system; search, show, info and queries only **read**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check yourself",
      "role": "quiz",
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Check yourself",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "On a fresh Ubuntu VM, `sudo apt install nginx` fails with 404 errors. Why, and what is the fix?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "The cached index is stale and points at package versions the server no longer has",
                "Run `sudo apt update` first. It refreshes the index and installs nothing"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "You run `sudo apt remove nginx`, then reinstall it. Is your edited `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf` still there?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Yes. `remove` keeps config files",
                "`purge` deletes them too. dnf has no purge: `remove` saves edited config files as `.rpmsave`"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "`sudo dpkg -i app.deb` stops with unmet dependencies. What is the bug?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "dpkg installs one local file and never resolves dependencies",
                "Use `sudo apt install ./app.deb` so apt fetches the missing ones"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
